#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:3
msgid "Deleted files"
msgstr "Comhaid scriosta"

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:5
msgid ""
"When you delete a file or folder in Nextcloud, it is normally moved to the "
"trash bin instead of being deleted immediately. This allows you to restore "
"it later."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a scriosann tú comhad nó fillteán i Nextcloud, aistrítear chuig an "
"mbosca bruscair é de ghnáth, in áit a bheith scriosta láithreach. Ligeann sé"
" seo duit é a chur ar ais níos déanaí."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:9
msgid ""
"Items in the trash bin are permanently deleted when one of the following "
"occurs:"
msgstr ""
"Scriostar míreanna sa bhosca bruscair go buan nuair a tharlaíonn ceann de na"
" rudaí seo a leanas:"

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:12
msgid "You manually select *Delete permanently*."
msgstr "Roghnaíonn tú *Scrios go buan* de láimh."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Deleted Files app removes the item according to the configured retention"
" policy."
msgstr ""
"Baineann an aip Comhaid Scriosta an mhír amach de réir an pholasaí coinneála"
" atá cumraithe."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:15
msgid ""
"The effective trash-bin size limit is exceeded and the item is eligible for "
"removal to free space."
msgstr ""
"Tá an teorainn éifeachtach ar mhéid an bhosca bruscair sáraithe, agus tá an "
"mhír incháilithe le baint chun spás a shaoradh."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:18
msgid ""
"Find your deleted files by selecting **Deleted files** in the Files area of "
"the Nextcloud Web interface. From there, you can restore items, download "
"them to your device, or delete them permanently."
msgstr ""
"Aimsigh do chomhaid scriosta trí **Comhaid scriosta** a roghnú i rannóg na "
"gComhad ar chomhéadan gréasáin Nextcloud. Ón áit sin, is féidir leat "
"míreanna a athchóiriú, iad a íoslódáil chuig do ghléas, nó iad a scriosadh "
"go buan."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:22
msgid ""
"When you restore an item, Nextcloud normally attempts to return it to its "
"original location. If that location no longer exists or is not writable, the"
" item is restored to the root of your Files area. If an item with the same "
"name already exists, Nextcloud gives the restored item a unique name."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a athchóiríonn tú mír, déanann Nextcloud iarracht de ghnáth í a chur "
"ar ais san áit a raibh sí ar dtús. Mura bhfuil an áit sin ann a thuilleadh, "
"nó mura féidir sonraí a scríobh inti, cuirfear an mhír ar ais ag fréamh do "
"chuid comhad. Má tá mír leis an ainm céanna ann cheana féin, sannfaidh "
"Nextcloud ainm uathúil don mhír atá á hathchóiriú."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:27
msgid ""
"If the Versions app is enabled, versions associated with a deleted file are "
"moved to the trash bin and are restored when the file is restored."
msgstr ""
"Má tá an aip Versions cumasaithe, aistrítear leaganacha a bhaineann le "
"comhad scriosta chuig an mbosca bruscair, agus déantar iad a athchóiriú "
"nuair a athchóirítear an comhad."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:31
msgid "Quotas"
msgstr "Cuótaí"

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:33
msgid ""
"Files and folders in your trash bin do not count against your normal storage"
" quota."
msgstr ""
"Ní chuirtear comhaid agus filléáin atá i do bhosca bruscair san áireamh i "
"gcoinne do ghnáthchuóta stórála."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:36
msgid ""
"See :doc:`quota` for more information about how storage quotas are "
"calculated."
msgstr ""
"Féach :doc:`quota` chun tuilleadh eolais a fháil faoin gcaoi a ríomhtar "
"cuótaí stórála."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:39
msgid "What happens when shared files are deleted"
msgstr "Cad a tharlaíonn nuair a scriostar comhaid roinnte"

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:41
msgid ""
"The behavior of deleted shared files depends on who deletes the item and who"
" owns it."
msgstr ""
"Braitheann iompar comhad comhroinnte a scriostar ar cé a scriosann an mhír "
"agus cé leis í."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:44
msgid ""
"For example, User1 shares a folder named ``TheProject/`` with User2 and "
"User3:"
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, roinneann Úsáideoir1 fillteán dar ainm ``TheProject/`` le "
"hÚsáideoir2 agus Úsáideoir3:"

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:46
msgid ""
"User2, a share recipient (sharee), deletes a folder or file named ``Phase2``"
" inside ``TheProject/``."
msgstr ""
"Scriosann User2, faighteoir comhroinnte, fillteán nó comhad dar ainm "
"``Phase2`` laistigh de ``TheProject/``."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:49
msgid ""
"``TheProject/Phase2`` is moved to the trash bin of User1, the owner, and a "
"copy is placed in User2's trash bin when possible. The item is removed from "
"the shared folder for User3, but User3 does not receive a copy in their "
"trash bin."
msgstr ""
"Aistrítear ``TheProject/Phase2`` chuig bosca bruscair User1, an t-úinéir, "
"agus cuirtear cóip i mbosca bruscair User2 nuair is féidir. Baintear an mhír"
" den fhillteán comhroinnte atá ag User3, ach ní fhaigheann User3 cóip ina "
"bhosca bruscair féin."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:54
msgid "User1, the owner, deletes ``TheProject/Phase2``."
msgstr "Scriosann User1, an t-úinéir, ``The Project/Phase 2``."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:56
msgid ""
"The item is moved to User1's trash bin and removed from the shared folder "
"for User2 and User3. It is not placed in their trash bins."
msgstr ""
"Bogtar an mhír chuig bosca bruscair User1 agus baintear den fhillteán "
"comhroinnte í atá ag User2 agus User3. Ní chuirtear i mboscaí bruscair an "
"bheirt sin í."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:59
msgid ""
"The exact behavior can depend on the type of share and the permissions "
"granted by the share. Depending on those permissions, other users may be "
"able to copy, rename, move, or re-share shared files. These operations can "
"affect which account owns the resulting files and which trash bin receives a"
" deleted item."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis an iompar beacht a bheith ag brath ar an gcineál comhroinnte "
"agus ar na ceadanna a bhaineann leis an gcomhroinnt sin. Ag brath ar na "
"ceadanna sin, d’fhéadfadh sé go mbeadh úsáideoirí eile in ann comhaid "
"chomhroinnte a chóipeáil, a athainmniú, a aistriú, nó a athchomhroinnt. Is "
"féidir leis na hoibríochtaí seo tionchar a imirt ar an gcuntas a bhfuil "
"úinéireacht aige ar na comhaid a thagann as, agus ar an mbosca bruscair a "
"fhaigheann mír a scriostar."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:66
msgid ""
"When a sharee deletes an item owned by another user, Nextcloud moves the "
"item to the owner's trash bin. A copy in the deleting user's trash bin is "
"also created (in most cases; the copy is on a best-effort basis and is not "
"guaranteed)."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a scriosann duine a bhfuil rochtain aige ar mhír í — mír atá faoi "
"úinéireacht úsáideora eile — bogann Nextcloud an mhír sin go dtí bosca "
"bruscair an úinéara. Cruthaítear cóip i mbosca bruscair an úsáideora a rinne"
" an scriosadh freisin (i bhformhór na gcásanna; déantar iarracht an chóip a "
"chruthú, ach níl sé ráthaithe)."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:72
msgid "How the Deleted Files app manages storage space"
msgstr "An chaoi a mbainistíonn an aip 'Comhaid Scriosta' spás stórála"

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:74
msgid ""
"The Deleted Files app manages trash-bin contents using two related rules:"
msgstr ""
"Bainistíonn an aip Comhaid Scriosta ábhar an bhosca bruscair trí úsáid a "
"bhaint as dhá riail ghaolmhara:"

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:76
msgid "A storage limit determines how much space the trash bin may use."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn teorainn stórála an méid spáis a fhéadfaidh an bosca bruscair a "
"úsáid."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:77
msgid ""
"A retention policy determines when deleted items become eligible for "
"permanent deletion."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn polasaí coinneála cathain a bhíonn míreanna scriosta incháilithe "
"le haghaidh scriosadh buan."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:81
msgid "Trash-bin storage limit"
msgstr "Teorainn stórála do bhoscaí bruscair"

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:83
msgid ""
"For accounts with a storage quota, the default trash-bin limit is up to 50% "
"of the account's remaining quota space. This is calculated after the "
"account's active files have been taken into account; it is not 50% of the "
"account's total quota."
msgstr ""
"I gcás cuntas a bhfuil cuóta stórála acu, is é 50% den spás atá fágtha sa "
"chuóta an teorainn réamhshocraithe don bhosca bruscair. Ríomhtar é seo tar "
"éis comhaid ghníomhacha an chuntais a chur san áireamh; ní hionann é agus "
"50% de chuóta iomlán an chuntais."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:88
msgid ""
"For example, if your quota is 10 GB and your active files use 8 GB, the "
"default trash-bin allowance is calculated from the remaining 2 GB."
msgstr ""
"Mar shampla, má tá cuóta 10 GB agat agus má úsáideann do chomhaid "
"ghníomhacha 8 GB, ríomhtar an leithdháileadh réamhshocraithe don bhosca "
"bruscair bunaithe ar an 2 GB atá fágtha."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:91
msgid ""
"For accounts without a storage quota, the default limit is calculated using "
"available filesystem space instead. Your administrator can override either "
"default by configuring a global or per-account trash-bin size."
msgstr ""
"I gcás cuntas gan cuóta stórála, ríomhtar an teorainn réamhshocraithe ag "
"baint úsáide as an spás córais comhad atá ar fáil ina ionad. Is féidir le do"
" riarthóir ceachtar réamhshocraithe a shárú trí mhéid bruscair domhanda nó "
"in aghaidh an chuntais a chumrú."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:95
msgid ""
"When the effective trash-bin limit is exceeded, Nextcloud removes eligible "
"deleted items, starting with the oldest items, until the limit is satisfied "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a sháraítear an teorainn éifeachtach don bhosca bruscair, baineann "
"Nextcloud míreanna scriosta atá incháilithe amach — ag tosú leis na míreanna"
" is sine — go dtí go gcomhlíontar an teorainn arís."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:100
msgid "Retention and permanent deletion"
msgstr "Coinneáil agus scriosadh buan"

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:102
msgid ""
"By default, deleted files are retained for at least 30 days. After that, "
"eligible items may be permanently deleted when space is needed; they are not"
" necessarily deleted immediately after 30 days."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, coinnítear comhaid scriosta ar feadh 30 lá ar a "
"laghad. Ina dhiaidh sin, d’fhéadfaí míreanna incháilithe a scriosadh go buan"
" nuair a bhíonn spás ag teastáil; ní gá go scriosfar iad díreach tar éis 30 "
"lá."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:106
msgid ""
"Your administrator can configure different minimum and maximum retention "
"periods. Depending on the configuration, items may be permanently deleted "
"after a maximum age even when storage space is not currently needed. "
"Automatic expiration can also be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le do riarthóir tréimhsí coinneála íosta agus uasta éagsúla a "
"chumrú. Ag brath ar an gcumraíocht, d’fhéadfaí míreanna a scriosadh go buan "
"tar éis tréimhse uasta, fiú mura bhfuil gá le spás stórála faoi láthair. Is "
"féidir an próiseas éaga uathoibríoch a dhíchumasú freisin."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:111
msgid ""
"For policies with a configured minimum retention period, an item is eligible"
" for space-based cleanup only after that period has elapsed. Policies "
"without a minimum retention period may allow space-based cleanup regardless "
"of the item's age. Items that have exceeded a configured maximum retention "
"period can be permanently deleted regardless of whether space is currently "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"I gcás polasaithe a bhfuil íostréimhse choinneála socraithe dóibh, ní bheidh"
" mír incháilithe le haghaidh glantacháin bunaithe ar spás ach amháin tar éis"
" don tréimhse sin a bheith caite. I gcás polasaithe nach bhfuil íostréimhse "
"choinneála acu, d’fhéadfaí glantachán bunaithe ar spás a cheadú, is cuma cén"
" aois atá ag an mír. Is féidir míreanna a sháraigh uastréimhse choinneála "
"shocraithe a scriosadh go buan, is cuma an bhfuil gá le spás faoi láthair nó"
" nach bhfuil."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:117
msgid ""
"The relevant configuration setting is ``trashbin_retention_obligation``. For"
" details about the available values and their interaction with quotas and "
"trash-bin sizes, see the `Deleted Files section of the Administrator Manual "
"<https://docs.nextcloud.com/server/latest/admin_manual/configuration_files/trashbin_configuration.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Is é ``trashbin_retention_obligation`` an socrú cumraíochta atá i gceist. "
"Chun tuilleadh sonraí a fháil faoi na luachanna atá ar fáil, agus faoin "
"gcaoi a n-idirghníomhaíonn siad le cuótaí agus le méideanna an bhosca "
"bruscair, féach an rannán `Comhaid Scriosta` i Lámhleabhar an Riarthóra "
"<https://docs.nextcloud.com/server/latest/admin_manual/configuration_files/trashbin_configuration.html>_."

#: ../../files/deleted_file_management.rst:125
msgid ""
"The Deleted Files app may permanently delete an item before its maximum "
"retention period when the effective trash-bin limit is exceeded and the "
"item's minimum retention period has elapsed."
msgstr ""
"D’fhéadfadh an aip 'Comhaid Scriosta' mír a scriosadh go buan roimh "
"dheireadh a tréimhse uasta coinneála, i gcás ina sáraítear an teorainn "
"éifeachtach don bhosca bruscair agus ina bhfuil an tréimhse íosta coinneála "
"don mhír sin caite."
